* 8 Nov 26 dm   Kimi's review: a click on the fifth provider row (Custom) was ignored - the hit box stopped at pr.y + 5, the size before Google; it now follows nprov.
*               The standing text's Save box said the text is "shown in each preview"; it is not shown there (S.160), and the box now says so.
* 7 Nov 26 dm   S.163: the Accounts box's header and the explanation say that SDSYS, the administrator, may always use the AI and has no gate.
* 7 Nov 26 dm   S.160: T opens the standing text (the text sent first with every AI request) in a box with an editor: Save, Shipped default, Cancel; SET.AI CONTEXT keeps it.
* 1 Nov 26 dm   GOOGLE IS A ROW (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, DeepSeek, Custom: five rows, the Provider box one row taller) AND EVERY NAMED PROVIDER HAS A DEFAULT MODEL (the owner, 1 Nov 2026:
*               "pre-filled in except for the key ... an option for a user specified model"): the table and the summary show the model that will be asked, a default marked (default), the
